  "instance_name": "mapping_id_1",
  "label": "The text 'a cracker' maps onto the crackers in the gourmet dish",
  "description": "The textual phrase 'a cracker' is directly mapped onto the visual entity of the crackers present in the gourmet dish. The crackers are a literal component of the dish, and the text uses them as a visual anchor to deliver the racial slur 'cracker'. This creates an analogical mapping where the crackers (visual) are equated with the slur (textual), reinforcing the derogatory association. The mapping is explicit through juxtaposition: the text identifies the crackers as 'a cracker', thereby projecting the slur onto the visual element.",
